{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S07等处压缩了人物反复追问和犹疑的过程，因果铺垫不如X完整、连贯。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点加亮让人扫一眼就能抓住每段的核心，感受又能随音乐出现，不必同时面对一大堆情绪词；它对声音、身体反应和情绪变化的描写也更具体细腻。X的完整句子在解释人物为什么犹疑、为什么改变想法时更顺畅，整体故事衔接两者各有优势。综合普通观众边听边看的体验，我会选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa1a1dec-f3dd-4e8a-84a7-d9c66a6730d5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T204759284377Z", "elapsed_seconds": 118.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:49:58.118992+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "910b6a93070ffa3ee045bf6fa806781034da68b8c83c29840865bb73e4cb7f64", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734b